'''Lesser Demon Cat''' is an [[:Category:Uber Rare Cats|Uber Rare Cat]] that can be unlocked via the [[Cat Capsule#Rare Capsule|Rare Capsule]] during [[THE DYNAMITES (Gacha Event)|THE DYNAMITES]] gacha event. It was added in [[Version 2.0 Update|Version 2.0]]. [[True Form]] added in [[Version 5.0 Update|Version 5.0]] greatly increases his attack power and health. [[Talents]] were added in [[Version 8.1 Update|Version 8.1]].

